      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wedding_(Berlin)"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Since the 1990s, Wedding has seen a significant influx of Africans, many settling in the Afrikanisches Viertel.",
